# Copy to .env (git-ignored). The service reads real environment variables
# directly — this file only documents what's needed; export these yourself
# or use a tool like direnv.
#
# Checked against the X-Internal-Token header on every /internal/v1/forecast
# call (ADR-0008: this service is now its own public deployment, with no
# private network standing in for a credential the way it did on Fly).
# Generate rather than choose, e.g. openssl rand -base64 32 — the same value
# goes in backend/.env as APP_MLSERVICE_TOKEN.
ML_SERVICE_TOKEN=
